                "Moly roaster R-3 on Powellite-Strath PS-7 already shows 8.6 vol% O2 in the tailgas "
                "against a 6.0 vol% ceiling, even though compressor discharge is only 4.2 bar under 5.5. "
                "The O2 channel should latch an 18.0-to-11.0 t/h air cut; trusting the header would leave "
                "18.0 t/h running. A seated hearth-arch crack on the discharge boot stays invisible to "
                "both publishers until AE fires.",